Consists of the other features and some other data in The Burgle Cats.

==Friends 「フレンド」==
An option where the player is able to send and receive friend requests via a ID that is unique to every account. This lets the player do Coop Heists with other players. If successful, they can earn Friend Points to buy various items and exclusive items in the [[The Burgle Cats/Shop|Shop]].

==Remodel 「ネコ入替」==
Named '''Select Cats''' in the Manor menu, an option that allows the player to configure the Cats that roam inside their Manor for optimized Snacks consumption and maximize Swipe amount.

==Missions 「ミッション」==
Completing missions allow you to obtain rewards such as: Tickets, Chests, Cat Food, Keys, Gold and premium Skins.

==Burgle Battle 「泥棒バトル」==
The main attraction of the game, two options are shown, Burgle Battle 「大泥棒バトル」 and Ticket Heist 「にゃんキケバトル」, along with Coop Heist.

*Burgle Battle 「大泥棒バトル」: The player will set off to another player's manor and try to steal the chest that they have stored in a hidden door, if successful an alarm will trigger and 4 of the escape routes will be closed so the player must locate to one of the open exits before they get caught or their willpower runs out. Optionally, the player is able to collect up to a total of 3 spirits from [[God (Special Cat)|Cat God]] before stealing a chest, if the player attempts to collect spirits after stealing a chest [[God (Special Cat)|Cat God]] will shake its head at the player.
*Ticket Heist 「にゃんキケバトル」: to start a ticket heist the player needs to spend a random amount of one type of Snacks, the player is able to gain a chest from completing the burglary. Depending on how many spirits the player collects any of [[God (Special Cat)|God Cat]] it will upgrade the chest's tier and reward the player with Silver and Rare Tickets.
**Collecting 0 spirits will keep the chest the same.
**Collecting 1 spirits will upgrade it to silver.
**Collecting 2 spirits will upgrade it to gold.
**Collecting 3 spirits will upgrade it to platinum.
*Coop Heist, the player can start a number of Coop Heists with another friend, each heist will cost a Friend Ticket, which can be held up to 3 and will refill to 3 every 24 hours. Coop Heist consists of 2 parts, if the first player fails the burglary, they can request help from the second player. Participating in a support battle in Coop Heist won't consume a Friend Ticket. The number of spirits collected from God Cat will affect the amount of Friend Points both players can earn.

== Security ==
This allows the player to design their manor with traps to stop other players from stealing their chests as well as move the producers.

==Factories ==
The player is assigned with 9 factories for Burgers, Soda and Drinks, which generate them over time, the player can spend those Snacks on the Cats for swiping to earn Gold, or on Ticket Heists. The maximum level of producers is affected by the stats in the
[[The Burgle Cats/Prayer|Prayer]].

